title: WarholClue0
---
<<play_animation Warhol Warhol_Coffee>>
Teacher Warhol: I always bring my own. The coffee machine in the lounge makes absolute swill. #line:warhol_teachers_lounge_C00_01
<<play_animation Warhol Warhol_Glance>>
Teacher Warhol: In fact, maybe we should take the news that it’s broken as a blessing in disguise, and buy an espresso machine for the lounge instead! #line:warhol_teachers_lounge_C00_02
===

title: WarholClue1
---
<<play_animation Warhol Warhol_Glance>>
Teacher Warhol: It’s just so unfair. Teacher Williams was already here, messing with the machine when I walked in. They’re probably the one that broke it. I got here late today. #line:warhol_teachers_lounge_C01
===

title: WarholClue2
---
Teacher Warhol: Oh, I arrived early to grade a bunch of the Advanced Art class homework. Aren't these portraits quite something? #line:warhol_teachers_lounge_C02
===


title: WilliamsClue0
---
<<play_animation Williams Williams_Forward>>
Teacher Williams: That’s kinda rude, but since you asked, yeah, I’m pretty tired. I would love some coffee, but the machine is broken. #line:williams_teachers_lounge_C00
===

title: WilliamsClue1
---
<<play_animation Williams Williams_Me>>
Teacher Williams: I can explain that, I was trying to fix the darn thing. I’m telling you, someone broke it on purpose before I got in today. Teacher Warhol was here early, you should be questioning her. #line:williams_teachers_lounge_C01
===

title: WilliamsClue2
---
<<play_animation Williams Williams_Forward>>
Teacher Williams: Look, I had a tough morning. By the time I got here, the regular lot was full and I had to park in the satellite lot and sprint over. #line:williams_teachers_lounge_C02
===


title: TeachersLoungeSuccess
---
Teacher Williams: Bet she was hoping you’d just pony up and buy a new machine for the lounge. Glad you saw through it. #line:teachers_lounge_success_01
<<play_animation Williams Williams_Forward>>
Teacher Williams: Hey, while I’m here, I wanted to tell you something weird about Pork Pie. Thought it might help with your investigation... #line:teachers_lounge_success_02
Teacher Williams: So, the day before it went missing, I saw Teacher Warhol heading into Pork Pie’s storage room, looking for something. Don’t know what for though. It’s not like we had a match coming up soon where it’d be needed. #line:teachers_lounge_success_03
<<play_animation Williams Williams_Me>>
Teacher Williams: I hate to say this, but do you think she might have taken good ol’ Porky? #line:teachers_lounge_success_04
<<next_case GameManager>>
===

title: TeachersLoungeFailure
---
Superintendent: What’s this I hear about you offering to buy Teacher Warhol a new espresso machine for the teachers' lounge?? You numbskull, she probably broke it herself, and you walked right into a trap! #line:teachers_lounge_failure_01
Superintendent: That’ll be coming out of your salary. And on top of that, now we have nobody to coach the softball game today! #line:teachers_lounge_failure_02
Superintendent: Oh, wait, yes we do, consider yourself up at bat. Good luck! #line:teachers_lounge_failure_03
<<next_case GameManager>>
===